[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8281.349, "timestamp": "02:18:01", "text": "我不知道我有没有在私信里提到过这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8283.589, "timestamp": "02:18:03", "text": "给你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8286.79, "timestamp": "02:18:06", "text": "所以我提到了，我提到了，呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8290.549, "timestamp": "02:18:10", "text": "问题是，他们……他们有一个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8293.19, "timestamp": "02:18:13", "text": "条件渲染站点。所以它检查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8297.589, "timestamp": "02:18:17", "text": "它会主动设置并检查时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8301.509, "timestamp": "02:18:21", "text": "涩谷的天气"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8304.629, "timestamp": "02:18:24", "text": "如果现在是正常情况，那也跟往常一样，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8306.95, "timestamp": "02:18:26", "text": "正常情况就是这样。如果下雨，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8309.27, "timestamp": "02:18:29", "text": "背景将是下雨的景象。如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8311.669, "timestamp": "02:18:31", "text": "晴天的话，背景也会是阳光明媚的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8314.95, "timestamp": "02:18:34", "text": "它是根据这个音乐视频改编的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8316.95, "timestamp": "02:18:36", "text": "如果天气晴朗，就会。如果是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8321.669, "timestamp": "02:18:41", "text": "晴天和雨天，她都会……嗯嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8324.23, "timestamp": "02:18:44", "text": "呃，她叫什么名字来着？我把她忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8326.79, "timestamp": "02:18:46", "text": "如果下雨，而且是晚上，那就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8330.389, "timestamp": "02:18:50", "text": "露卡就是这样。是的，这将是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8332.79, "timestamp": "02:18:52", "text": "夜晚下着雨，就会像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8334.309, "timestamp": "02:18:54", "text": "这。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8337.99, "timestamp": "02:18:57", "text": "如果现在是早上，如果是"}]